rule RepeatFaultsPreventiveMaintenance
	lineageTag: 7dc0f86f-b88f-5b98-8f2d-c1562f190974
	statement: Three or more work orders on the same station within one hour require the Maintenance Lead to pull the station for preventive maintenance and run a root-cause review, regardless of the PM schedule.

	ruleReferencedEntity maintenance#WorkOrder
		propertyScope: specific
		ruleReferencedProperty created_at

	ruleReferencedEntity equipment#Station

	ruleReferencedRelationship maintenance#WorkOrderOnStation
